      "highlight": [
       [
        4,
        2
       ]
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "p",
     "set": {
      "text": "AND"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Now read L as 1 and H as 0 (negative logic). Every 0 becomes 1 and vice versa, in the inputs and in the output.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "t3",
     "set": {
      "hidden": false
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "neg",
     "set": {
      "hidden": false
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Sort the negative-logic rows into the usual order 00, 01, 10, 11: F reads 0, 1, 1, 1. The same chip is an OR gate.",
